nc-clothing-outer-armor-jacket-black = black light armorjack
    .desc = A black street jacket reinforced with flexible kevlar. Quiet styling for loud neighborhoods.

nc-clothing-outer-armor-jacket-maroon = maroon light armorjack
    .desc = A maroon street jacket with discreet ballistic lining. Stylish enough for the club and practical enough for the walk home.

nc-clothing-outer-armor-jacket-red = red light armorjack
    .desc = A vivid red armorjack reinforced with flexible kevlar. Subtlety was never part of the design brief.

nc-clothing-outer-armor-jacket-turquoise = turquoise light armorjack
    .desc = A turquoise armorjack with flexible ballistic reinforcement and bright street-fashion accents.

nc-clothing-outer-armor-jacket-violet = violet light armorjack
    .desc = A violet armorjack lined with kevlar. Its neon accents remain visible through the red haze.

